#: ../data/calculator.scope.in.h:3
msgid ""
"This is an Ubuntu search plugin that enables Calculator results to be "
"displayed in the Dash underneath the Info header. If you do not wish to "
"search this content source, you can disable this search plugin."
msgstr ""
"Esti ye un complementu de gueta qu'habilita los resultaos de la Calculadora "
"p'amosalos nel Tableru perbaxo de la testera Información. Si nun deseyes "
"guetar nesta fonte de conteníu, pues deshabilitar esti complementu de gueta."
